  "source_alignment_limits": [
    "FrogID data are occurrence-level call-positive species records, not standardized recording opportunities including silence. The denominator is 982 distinct submissions containing at least one identified frog species and with eventID.",
    "11 taxon rows have missing eventID and are excluded from submission denominator; their 2018-2019 monthly occurrence counts remain in 1731.",
    "Target species public coordinates are obscured to about 10km and 70x80km regional inclusion cannot prove wetland identity.",
    "Only one Anax original observed season and six Litoria-positive source recordings; these are not six independent habitat replicates.",
    "No rainfall, recorder selection or local effort matched; observational weekly Pearson r values are purely exploratory without corrected p values.",
    "A zero source species-positive in FrogID week is not evidence of no callers; lack of Anax survey in week is represented null, not zero.",
    "Predation records are month-only and not attributable to the matching week/site. No dated biological role-switch or heterospecific alarm responses measured."
  ]
